# Kernel module build artifacts. Slashless patterns anchor at no depth,
# so they match the .o/.cmd files kbuild drops into kernel/{core,hooks,ipc}.
*.o
*.ko
*.ko.*
*.mod
*.mod.c
*.mod.o
*.mod.o.cmd
*.cmd
*.symvers
*.order
kernel/Module.symvers
kernel/modules.order

